are)."] [644 4 "// a static type's tp_name is its module's and its name (select.poll)"] [690 25 "// its __del__ at its death (finalize.go, queue 218)"] [709 2 "// The data model's slots of object and type (REQUEST to PY5b: leave these to class.go)."] [722 1 "// ---- the slots of a class (fixup_slot_dispatchers, update_slot) ----"] [728 1 "// pyDefined is name defined by a heap class of t's MRO (a Python method), and its value."] [737 1 "// fixupSlots fills t's slots: the built-in solid base's (unwrapping a built-in subclass's value),"] [738 1 "// then a dispatcher for each special method a class of the MRO defines. Rerun on a class's"] [739 1 "// special attribute's assignment, for it and its subclasses."] [750 21 "// a custom mro() without object (typeNew refuses such a class afterwards)"] [765 28 "// bytearray's str is its repr"] [769 34 "// list___init__ and set_init ask the class of the instance"] [772 34 "// deque_iter: dequeiter_reduce gives the instance back"] [775 4 "// dict's subscript sees the subclass's instance (its __missing__; dict's accessors take the"] [776 4 "// instance through BuiltinValueHook): PY5e, part 2b"] [858 6 "// _PyObject_MaybeCallSpecialOneArg: a descriptor's AttributeError reads as no such method"] [913 4 "// slot_tp_call's _Py_EnterRecursiveCall (REQUEST of PY6g for PY6-core: test_descr's"] [914 4 "// test_recursive_call, A.__call__ = A(), overflowed Go's stack)"] [1083 1 "// reprOfInstance are the built-in types whose repr names the instance's own type (_PyType_Name(Py_TYPE(self)):"] [1084 1 "// deque's, defaultdict's): their subclasses' instances reach the Repr slot as they are, not unwrapped (PY7: a"] [1085 1 "// subclass's repr named the base)."] [1088 1 "// unwrapSlots makes a built-in base's slots work on its subclass's instances: each argument that is"] [1089 1 "// such an instance replaced by its value, and the base's __new__'s value wrapped in the instance."] [1113 16 "// an iterator's own: the instance, not its value (iter(e